{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"submission\":\"update.json\",\"summary\":\"The slow-store probe ran (CheckRun 394ae390a0164b5dbda779132c28478d, exit 0) and returned a second zero - 768 deliveries, 4605 term samples, no falls, the term climbing monotonically to 2306 in memory and in the store - and working out why is worth more than the count. Two structural reasons emerge, and both narrow the hazard's preconditions rather than refuting it. The deliveries that create the off-thread write are the same events that refresh the follower's last contact, so a stream of them keeps the node from starting the election it would have to collide with; a campaign needs silence and a heartbeat ends the silence. Sharper still: with a uniform store latency both writers sleep the same amount, so the write that starts later, the heartbeat's, finishes later and is applied last, leaving the higher term in place, which is the opposite of a fall. The regression therefore needs the main loop's write to take effect after the off-thread one, an asymmetry in scheduling rather than a wide window; the gate achieved exactly that by holding that write open until the heartbeat's write had completed, and a fast heartbeat write against a delayed, contended election write is the shape that would achieve it naturally. I recorded the observation as a fact, answered the open question with that conditional account and stated the precondition plainly instead of leaving the timing story as an unexplained narrow window, and kept the defect claim where the evidence is - on the mechanism and the three receipts that show it - rather than on either probe's zero, which I read as a bound on how easily the ordering arises. The counterweights and limits are recorded, including that no election even started during the slow-store run, that the asymmetry argument is source-based because the contended-persist configuration was not constructed, and that both probes still deliver through the wrapper transport on a single voter. The six witnessed findings, the reproduced and controlled regression, the two knowledge corrections and the scoped log-cache negative remain recorded and unaffected.\"}"}}
